# PicoX3D Master Pinout Reference

Board Target: **Raspberry Pi Pico / Pico 2 (RP2040 / RP2350)**  
Firmware Compatibility: **Marlin 2.x / Klipper**  
Project: **PicoX3D (Hack Club Freestyle Tier 1)**

